{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231070","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1023107001:1":{"text":"안녕하세요! 싸우는 사람이 있다고 들었는데, 무슨 일이죠?","source_cn":"嗨，听你们在说有人吵架，具体是什么情况？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93DF1E2FBD6CBA6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1023107002:1":{"text":"어휴, 여기선 흔해요. 북촌의 가난뱅이 때문에 로리엣이 자기 아버지와 매일 싸우고 있거든요. 요즘 좀 심해지긴 했지만...","source_cn":"唉，我们已经司空见惯了。为了北村的那个穷小子，罗丽叶和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9804E7EE5963D28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1023107003:1":{"text":"로리엣 양과 아버지의 의견 충돌이 있나 보네요. 왜 싸우는 거죠?","source_cn":"听起来这位罗丽叶小姐和她父亲有些意见不合，他们为什么要吵架？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x272F6A5AE8158FAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1023107004:1":{"text":"로리엣이 기어코 북촌의 줄리오를 만나겠다는데, 아버지인 자르단이 허락하지 않고 있거든요...","source_cn":"这个罗丽叶，非要和北村的朱密欧在一起，可她父亲贾尔丹坚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DC55C4260594682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1023107005:1":{"text":"온종일 집에서 죽네사네 하고 있어요. 자르단은 딸이 남자를 만나지 못하게 하려고 집문까지 걸어 잠갔고요!","source_cn":"小姑娘整天在家里搞得像要死要活的。为了阻止她去见那个男...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD221934FBF5F3251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1023107006:1":{"text":"집에 갇혀서... 줄리오가 로리엣을 만나지 못한 거였군요.","source_cn":"难怪朱密欧说见不到罗丽叶……原来她根本走不出家门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C78CA2C53310376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1023107007:1":{"text":"자르단도 참 독해요. 로리엣은 벌써 며칠째 단식하고 있거든요.\n저라면 딸이 그러는 건 못 봐요.","source_cn":"要说这贾尔丹也真够狠的，罗丽叶都绝食好几天了。\\n换做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13F99EFE73650642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1023107007":{"text":"자르단도 참 독해요. 로리엣은 벌써 며칠째 단식하고 있거든요.\n저라면 딸이 그러는 건 못 봐요.","source_cn":"要说这贾尔丹也真够狠的，罗丽叶都绝食好几天了。\\n换做是我，我可舍不得让自己女儿饿肚子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13F99EFE73650642","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1023107008:3":{"text":"로리엣 양의 집은 어디죠? ","source_cn":"这位罗丽叶小姐的家在哪儿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A6AFF2FD69E678A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1023107009:1":{"text":"북서쪽에 있는 울타리로 둘러싸인 집이에요.","source_cn":"喏，从这里往西北面走，看见那家围满栅栏的就是了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9340DFDC9D41CAF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_femal